{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00587","headline":"郊庙歌辞 释奠武成王乐章 迎俎酌献 · 于邵","name":"郊庙歌辞 释奠武成王乐章 迎俎酌献","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五齐洁，九牢硕。\n梡橛循，罍斝涤。\n进具物，扬鸿绩。\n和奏发，高灵寂。\n虔告终，繁祉锡。\n昭秩祀，永无易。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于邵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00587.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00587","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}